    "scope": "Four actually inspected2013/2018 facade/court/colonnade/minaret pictures plus standard viewer PMTiles/DEM. No bespoke surveys or redistributed photographs;current finish unverified.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Sheikh_Zayed_Mosque_view.jpg",
        "author": "Wikiemirati",
        "date": "2018-04-29",
        "license": "Reference viewed only;photograph not redistributed",
        "observed": "Inspected720×720 main-hall/courtyard picture:three large white onion domes and smaller front bulb,arched-window drums,tall framed central pointed entrance with flanking fields. Low courtyard horseshoe/keyhole arcades on paired or grouped white columns with gold palm capitals;floral marble paving. Four-stage minaret silhouette includes square lower shaft,octagonal transition,large balcony,patterned round upper shaft,second balcony and open lantern. Fine inlay and lettering omitted."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Water_mirror_and_columns_in_Sheikh_Zayed_Mosque.jpg",
        "author": "FritzDaCat",
        "date": "2013-03-24",
        "license": "Reference viewed only;photograph not redistributed",
        "observed": "Inspected960×640 exterior water-mirror picture:blue-grey pool directly borders a double colonnade. Slender paired/four-column clusters on shared plinths,wide gold palm-leaf capitals,pointed/scalloped white outer arches and white vaulted gallery ceiling. Floral column inlay and exact paving pattern are omitted or represented by original broad accents."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Front_of_Sheikh_Zayed_Mosque.jpg",
        "author": "FritzDaCat",
        "date": "2013-03-28",
        "license": "Reference viewed only;photograph not redistributed",
        "observed": "Inspected960×640 exterior gate/pool picture:wide round-headed keyhole openings narrow at their waist over paired columns,white onion caps with stacked gold finials and lacy pointed parapet. Tall rectangular gateway with pointed inset and flanking grille panels. Multi-stage minaret has projecting balconies and open upper lantern;outside pool interrupts at solid entrance. Carved lace,grilles,floral inlay and inscriptions simplified."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Inner_court_yard_of_Shekh_Zayed_Mosque.jpg",
        "author": "FritzDaCat",
        "date": "2013-03-24",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0/GFDL photograph;viewed only,not redistributed",
        "observed": "Inspected500×750 court/minaret picture:very slender tall square shaft with small gold side balconies and inset vertical panels;octagonal taper,large corbelled circular balcony,round diagonally patterned upper shaft,second balcony,open lantern and small gold cap. Keyhole court arches on gold-topped columns,low onion caps and pointed parapet;white reflective paving. Picture proportions guide working stages,not surveyed dimensions."
      }
    ]
